    "show_share": true,
    "description": "He is one of the world's leading interventional cardiologists - a recipient of countless international awards and honours including Recognition Awards from the American Heart Association, the Indian National Institute of Heart Diseases and the Pakistan Society of Cardiology. His breadth of experience spans military assignments, academic positions, hospital appointments, and administrative responsibilities. He is currently an Executive Director of the Interventional Cardiology Research Institute in Maryland, a Director of Interventional Cardiology at Washington Adventist Hospital and a Clinical Professor of Cardiology at the George Washington University School of Medicine in Washington D.C. and also serves on the editorial boards of several medical journals.",
